tan me brūhi su-niścitam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1557,\"bb\":1379,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/1/b1379/\",\"shadow_value\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca – Arjuna said; sannyāsam – renunciation; karmaṇām – of all activities; kṛṣṇa – O Kṛṣṇa; punaḥ – again; yogam – devotional service; ca – also; śaṁsasi – You are praising; yat – which; śreyaḥ – is more beneficial; etayoḥ – of these two; ekam – one; tat – that; me – unto me; brūhi – please tell; su-niścitam – definitely.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Arjuna said\"},{\"word\":\"sannyāsam\",\"translation\":\"renunciation\"},{\"word\":\"karmaṇām\",\"translation\":\"of all activities\"},{\"word\":\"kṛṣṇa\",\"translation\":\"O Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"punaḥ\",\"translation\":\"again\"},{\"word\":\"yogam\",\"translation\":\"devotional service\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"śaṁsasi\",\"translation\":\"You are praising\"},{\"word\":\"yat\",\"translation\":\"which\"},{\"word\":\"śreyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"is more beneficial\"},{\"word\":\"etayoḥ\",\"translation\":\"of these two\"},{\"word\":\"ekam\",\"translation\":\"one\"},{\"word\":\"tat\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"unto me\"},{\"word\":\"brūhi\",\"translation\":\"please tell\"},{\"word\":\"su-niścitam\",\"translation\":\"definitely\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1558,\"bb\":1380,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/1/b1380/\",\"body_value\":\"Arjuna said: O Kṛṣṇa, first of all You ask me to renounce work, and then again You recommend work with devotion. Now will You kindly tell me definitely which of the two is more beneficial?\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"titl